stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> AwaitingAcceptance
 AwaitingAcceptance --> Accepted: supplier accepts
 AwaitingAcceptance --> Cancelled: buyer cancels
 Accepted --> Funded: buyer funds exact SDD
 Accepted --> Cancelled: deadline expires + buyer cancels
 Funded --> DocumentReview: first document commitment
 DocumentReview --> InspectionPending: required docs + inspector
 InspectionPending --> InspectionPassed: inspector PASS
 InspectionPending --> InspectionFailed: inspector FAIL
 InspectionPassed --> ReleaseAuthorized: agent; snapshot permits immediate release
 InspectionPassed --> ReleaseAuthorized: buyer confirms within 72h; no immediate agent permission
 InspectionPassed --> Disputed: either party before ReleaseAuthorized
 InspectionFailed --> RefundAuthorized: agent; snapshot permits refund
 InspectionFailed --> RefundAuthorized: buyer requests refund
 InspectionFailed --> Disputed: buyer opens dispute
 Funded --> Disputed: either party
 DocumentReview --> Disputed: either party
 InspectionPending --> Disputed: either party
 Disputed --> ReleaseAuthorized: resolver releases
 Disputed --> RefundAuthorized: resolver refunds
 ReleaseAuthorized --> PayoutPending: any caller triggers
 RefundAuthorized --> RefundPending: any caller triggers
 PayoutPending --> Completed: callback success
 PayoutPending --> ReleaseAuthorized: callback failure
 RefundPending --> Refunded: callback success
 RefundPending --> RefundAuthorized: callback failure
